{"id":39436,"date":"2025-01-03T00:13:13","date_gmt":"2025-01-02T23:13:13","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-winter-challenge-s-a-vila-gale-2025\/"},"modified":"2026-09-03T01:41:37","modified_gmt":"2026-09-03T00:41:37","slug":"trail-winter-challenge-s-a-vila-gale","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-winter-challenge-s-a-vila-gale\/","title":{"rendered":"Trail Winter Challenge S.A. \u2013 Vila Gal\u00e9 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trail Winter Challenge S.A. \u2013 Vila Gal\u00e9 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>3\u00ba Trail Winter Challenge S.A. \u2013 Vila Gal\u00e9 2026<\/strong> convida-te a desafiar as arribas oce\u00e2nicas e as fal\u00e9sias da <strong>Ericeira<\/strong> num dos cen\u00e1rios costeiros mais deslumbrantes da Reserva Mundial de Surf. Com concentra\u00e7\u00e3o e partida junto ao <strong>Hotel Vila Gal\u00e9 da Ericeira (Praia da Baleia)<\/strong>, o evento integra o prestigiado Circuito Challenge S.A. 2026.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O programa disponibiliza o <strong>Trail Longo (20 km)<\/strong>, o <strong>Trail Curto (12 km)<\/strong> e uma magn\u00edfica <strong>Caminhada de 10 km<\/strong>. Al\u00e9m de medalha finisher em formato puzzle exclusiva, os atletas concorrem a estadias duplas nos hot\u00e9is Vila Gal\u00e9 (Portugal, Brasil e Espanha) e desfrutam de um acolhedor conv\u00edvio final com ch\u00e1, caf\u00e9 e bolinhos.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">13 de Dezembro de 2026 \u00e0s 09:30<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 2