: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 1:<\/strong> 13.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 31 Dez)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 2:<\/strong> 16.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (1 Jan a 7 Dez)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o Trail Winter Challenge 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento decorre no domingo, <strong>13 de Dezembro de 2026<\/strong>, com partida junto ao <strong>Hotel Vila Gal\u00e9 Ericeira<\/strong> (acesso \u00e0 Praia da Baleia).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os hor\u00e1rios de partida das provas?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O Trail Longo de 20 km parte \u00e0s <strong>09h30<\/strong>, o Trail Curto de 12 km \u00e0s <strong>09h40<\/strong> e a Caminhada de 10 km \u00e0s <strong>09h45<\/strong>. O secretariado abre \u00e0s 07h45.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Existe limite de participantes no evento?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, as inscri\u00e7\u00f5es est\u00e3o limitadas a <strong>500 vagas confirmadas<\/strong> no conjunto das dist\u00e2ncias para garantir a preserva\u00e7\u00e3o dos trilhos e o conforto dos atletas.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Que pr\u00e9mios est\u00e3o em disputa no evento?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Os vencedores por escal\u00e3o ganham estadias duplas nos hot\u00e9is Vila Gal\u00e9. Todos os participantes recebem um voucher de desconto de 20\u20ac Vila Gal\u00e9 e participam no sorteio de estadias.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso realizar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o no evento?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es realizam-se atrav\u00e9s do portal oficial <strong>Trilho Perdido<\/strong> (www.trilhoperdido.com) com pagamento via MB Way ou Refer\u00eancia Multibanco.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Trail Winter Challenge S.A. \u2013 Vila Gal\u00e9 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-12-13\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Hotel Vila Gal\u00e9 Ericeira (Praia da Baleia)\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Mafra\", \"addressRegion\": \"Lisboa\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"S\u00f3nia Andrade (S.A.) \/ Circuito Challenge S.A.\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o Trail Winter Challenge 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento decorre no domingo, 13 de Dezembro de 2026 , com partida junto ao Hotel Vila Gal\u00e9 Ericeira (acesso \u00e0 Praia da Baleia).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os hor\u00e1rios de partida das provas?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O Trail Longo de 20 km parte \u00e0s 09h30 , o Trail Curto de 12 km \u00e0s 09h40 e a Caminhada de 10 km \u00e0s 09h45 . O secretariado abre \u00e0s 07h45.\"